{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00074",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.97,
      "end_seconds": 3.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, I hope I'm not interrupting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.3,
      "end_seconds": 8.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "No trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.92,
      "end_seconds": 18.27,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "It's yellow eyes. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.19,
      "end_seconds": 23.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "And when did that start? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.26,
      "end_seconds": 26.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Ever since... since last night, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.97,
      "end_seconds": 30.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.77,
      "end_seconds": 36.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "It usually comes with pale stools. The pale stools? That's been for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.94,
      "end_seconds": 42.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.4,
      "text": "Alright, is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.9,
      "end_seconds": 53.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.51,
      "end_seconds": 60.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any vomiting blood, swelling of the tummy or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.96,
      "end_seconds": 65.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.96,
      "end_seconds": 70.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.94,
      "end_seconds": 71.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.15,
      "end_seconds": 85.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.11,
      "end_seconds": 88.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.43,
      "end_seconds": 105.28,
      "duration_seconds": 15.85,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.01,
      "end_seconds": 111.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.34,
      "end_seconds": 118.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.49,
      "end_seconds": 121.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.68,
      "end_seconds": 125.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.79,
      "end_seconds": 128.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.31,
      "end_seconds": 132.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.62,
      "end_seconds": 135.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.66,
      "end_seconds": 137.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.43,
      "end_seconds": 144.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.73,
      "end_seconds": 147.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Right, are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.1,
      "end_seconds": 150.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "No, I don't take anything regularly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.28,
      "end_seconds": 154.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "One moment, the system's being slow today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.35,
      "end_seconds": 156.21,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.3,
      "end_seconds": 169.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.42,
      "end_seconds": 179.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.95,
      "end_seconds": 218.79,
      "duration_seconds": 19.84,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 112 over 78, temperature is 36.8 degrees. And respiratory rate 14, pulse 81. Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.22,
      "end_seconds": 226.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Okay, so good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.8,
      "end_seconds": 231.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.01,
      "end_seconds": 235.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "I'll just listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.97,
      "end_seconds": 249.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "The whites of your eyes are yellow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.88,
      "end_seconds": 273.01,
      "duration_seconds": 18.13,
      "text": "Okay, all done, thank you, please sit down. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. Putting it all together, it fits best with jaundice with a cause we still need to find."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.53,
      "end_seconds": 275.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.87,
      "end_seconds": 295.81,
      "duration_seconds": 18.94,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like jaundice with a cause we still need to find, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had yellow eyes, since last night, and no confusion or swelling of the tummy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.34,
      "end_seconds": 298.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.16,
      "end_seconds": 303.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "I'm going to order liver function tests, for jaundice."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.18,
      "end_seconds": 306.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Okay, you know, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.37,
      "end_seconds": 328.56,
      "duration_seconds": 21.19,
      "text": "Please avoid alcohol completely and don't take any painkillers except paracetamol, and not much of that. Cut back on tea, coffee and fizzy drinks for a couple of weeks and see how things settle. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you vomit blood or become drowsy or confused. Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.47,
      "end_seconds": 330.17,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.44,
      "end_seconds": 337.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.26,
      "end_seconds": 343.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.53,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.62,
      "end_seconds": 351.89,
      "duration_seconds": 5.27,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.72,
      "end_seconds": 355.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}